{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2023-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1678924800, "end_date": 1679615999, "month_true_total": 108, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:58:07 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "135259320", "author": {"steamid": "76561198447913590", "personaname": "ChrisRedfieldsPecs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198447913590/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 632, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 632, "last_played": 1608303670, "avatar": "71ded71f0734746f8a262d315ff745911075b760"}, "language": "english", "review": "LOOK AT WHAT THEY DID TO MY BOY!!! WHHYYYYYYYY!!! AAAHHHHH-HA-HA- WHYYYYYY", "timestamp_created": 1679603170, "timestamp_updated": 1679603170, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.484949827194213867", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135253307", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065633576", "personaname": "Draconiam", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Draconiam/", "num_games_owned": 798, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 2302, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 190, "last_played": 1783101358, "avatar": "eecb34e26ea59067475bc411c73da82162960079"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love all things Mass Effect, but Andromeda was such a great addition to the franchise, it may have flaws, but so did the og trilogy.", "timestamp_created": 1679597597, "timestamp_updated": 1679597597, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135252166", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962431078", "personaname": "NaytoE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/naytoe/", "num_games_owned": 754, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 189, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 189, "last_played": 1679599198, "avatar": "49ce0e2c54cbc3b88d90f5068f4caed6314089c3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game has been rendered unplayable due to EA turning off Origin and forcing me to update to the EA Play app, which doesn't work for ANY of my EA games through Steam.\n\nWell done EA, proving you're useless once again.\n\n*Slow Clap*", "timestamp_created": 1679596570, "timestamp_updated": 1679596570, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 459, "votes_funny": 24, "weighted_vote_score": "0.894043445587158203", "comment_count": 16, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 8}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 22, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "135169158", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027087805", "personaname": "Kritix", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027087805/", "num_games_owned": 272, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 6833, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6714, "last_played": 1679518321, "avatar": "3e9541a7d4c419f8e9f9cdf5d287e47d9b06a717"}, "language": "english", "review": "First a disclaimer: Its not really a bad game, its just worse than any fromt he original trilogy in my opinion.\n\nSo andromeda is a try to bring big openworld to the mass effect franchise... and its not a very good one. \nTravel between planets is just horendous, especially if you get some quest which has you jump several systems with little to do inbwtween. \nEconomy is kinda broken int he game, money is straight up useless as there was not a single thing in a whole game (except for some quest items or one quest) i needed to buy. Research and crafting is kinda nice, but i crafted new set of gear three times during entire playtrough and once was just to get a shiny new gear before last quest and wanst needed at all. So looting is also pointless, rpg game where looting is boring... thats not good.\nIn combat you can use just 3 powers which removes a lot from combos you could pull off in previous games.\nStory is... well actually quite short, if you would not bother with side quests this would be extremely short game. But its kinda decent even despite the fact that it is quite predictable. Finale is not bad and they kinda make you feel like real hero leading all your allies to the big battle for the fate of the galaxy and they done decent job on that.\n\nAll in all, its decent game, but compared to older ones from the series it just doesn't hold.", "timestamp_created": 1679503822, "timestamp_updated": 1679503822, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500636935234069824", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135167978", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072127953", "personaname": "fyzikar123", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072127953/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 295, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 295, "last_played": 1679434002,